<title>GERMANY: German Oct steel output down 0.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>German Oct steel output down 0.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office gave the following data on pan-German steel production (in millions of tonnes):</p>
<p>				   Pct change     Pig iron	 2.49	 -2.6</p>
<p>    Crude steel    3.62	 -0.4</p>
<p>		     Jan-Oct     Pct Change</p>
<p>    Pig iron	22.83	-10.5</p>
<p>    Crude steel   32.84	 -8.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Percentage changes are against year-earlier figures.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
